    "digest": "Switch between off and on (0/1)",
    "description": "live.toggle sends a 0 as output when it is turned off and a 1 as output when it is turned on (when giving input, a non-zero number will turn it on, a 0 will turn it off, and a bang will alternate the state of the toggle).",
